[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はぁ、はぁっ……おのれ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hah, hah... Damn you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私たちの、勝ちみたいね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Looks like we won."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まだだ……余はまだ動けるッ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Not yet... I can still move!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "くっ、しぶといっ……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh, she's stubborn...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "鏑矢様……これ以上は、もう……\nゆっくり、休んでください……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My lord... please, no more... Rest now..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ならぬ、余が一刻でも休めば\nそれだけ理想のケイウンが遠ざかる……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I cannot... If I rest even for a moment, my ideal Keiun grows ever more distant..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "大丈夫です……鏑矢様なら……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's all right... You can do it..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふっ……忌々しいが……やはり、心地よい、な……\nお前の腕の中……は……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hah... How vexing... but still... so comforting... being in your arms..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "死んじゃった！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Did she die?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミーケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……いいえ。気を失ってしまわれたようです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...No. She's just lost consciousness."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よかった……ここで鏑矢さんを失っていたら\n千歳が可哀そうだもの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank goodness... If we'd lost Kaburaya here, poor Chitose would have been heartbroken."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ディオーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょっと、何かする気なら黙ってないわよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, if you're planning something, I won't stand by and watch."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "安心しろナナ。これ以上、手は出さん。\nこの事件、黒幕は別にいるようだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't worry, Nana. I won't take any further action. This incident... it seems there's another mastermind behind it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "しかし、心の奥底に反乱の意思があったことも事実。\nこの事件が片付いた後、下手な動きをしようものなら",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "However, the fact remains that rebellious intent lurked in her heart. Once this incident is resolved, if she makes any foolish moves..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その時は、私は容赦しない。\n九偉人として、戦乱の芽を摘む",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I will show no mercy. As one of the Nine, I'll nip the seeds of war in the bud."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "鏑矢様は……とても心根の優しいお方です。\n必ず、この国を良き道へと導いてくださるはずです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My lord has... such a gentle heart. I'm certain she will guide this nation down the right path."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……今はその言葉を信じるとしよう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...For now, I'll trust in those words."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ありがとう、ございます",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Thank you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふう……ひやひやしたあ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Phew... that was nerve-wracking."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミーケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "では、今こそ玉涎香を打ち消す覚醒香を\n焚くとしましょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now then, let us burn the awakening incense to counter the Jade Nectar."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……私は先に牢へと向かう。\n黒幕をどうにかせねばなるまい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I'll head to the prison first. Something must be done about the mastermind."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私は、ここで鏑矢様を看ています",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll stay here and watch over my lord."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わたくしも残りましょう。\nお二人だけを残していくのは不安ですので",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I shall remain as well. I'd be concerned leaving just the two of you alone."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ララ様が残るのでしたら、私とミーケちゃんも",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If Queen Lara is staying, then Mieke and I will too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ディオーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "分かったわ。行きましょ、ユミア、アイラ。\nそれに……ゴゥも",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Got it. Let's go, Yumia, Isla. And... Gou too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ん、む……余は、いったい……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mmm... What... happened to me...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "鏑矢様……ご機嫌、いかが、ですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lady Kaburaya... How are you feeling?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ……この香のおかげか頭の中がすっきりする。\nこのような気持ちは久方ぶりだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah... thanks to this incense, my mind feels clear. I haven't felt this way in so long."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まるで夢から醒めたような……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's as if I've been awakened from a dream..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いや夢ではなかった……\nこの現状を……余が招いたのだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, it wasn't a dream... This situation... I brought it upon myself."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "鏑矢様……元に戻って、くださって……っく\nわたし、はっ……嬉しゅう……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Y-you've returned to your true self... I'm... so happy..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "千歳、泣くな……とは言えないな。\nお前には迷惑と苦労をかけた",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose, I can't tell you not to cry... I've caused you nothing but trouble and hardship."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "道を誤ったときには命を賭して正してくれる……\nあなたも良き仲間に恵まれたようですわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "When one strays from the path, having companions who will risk their lives to set you right... You are blessed with good friends indeed."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……名は？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Your name?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ララ・キングダムの王……\nララ・トロッケルですわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I am the queen of the Kingdom of Lara... Lara Trockel."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さあ、正気に戻ったのならば、\nすべきことがあるのではなくて？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now then, if you've regained your senses, you have duties to attend to, do you not?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ。今までのこともすべて覚えている。\n自分がしでかした不始末は、自分でけりを付けねばな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. I remember everything that happened. The mess I created—I must up the mess I made."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ。それこそ、人の上に立つ者の責務",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed. That is the responsibility of one who rules."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ミーケ、ディオーナ。行きますわよ。\nこの方々を、無事に送り届けるためにも",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke, Diona. We're going. We must see these people safely through this."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "承知いたしました。露払いはお任せください！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Understood. Leave clearing the path to me!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ディオーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "大船に乗ったつもりでね！\u3000ビーッグ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Consider it done! MAJORLY done!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミーケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……千歳。お前もついてきてくれるか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Chitose. Will you come with me?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "当然にございます。\n鏑矢様、千歳はどこまでも、あなたと共に……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course. I will follow you wherever you go..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]